{"schema_version":2,"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","events":[{"id":"wudi-e-o022c","title":"曹操受降并组青州兵","accounts":[{"id":"wudi-e-o022c-account","label":"正文","text":"曹操追黄巾至济北，冬季受降，选精锐编为青州兵。","evidence":["wudi-e-o022c-q"]}],"participants":[{"person":"cao-cao","role":"受降编军","evidence":["wudi-e-o022c-q"]}],"place":{"text":"济北","evidence":["wudi-e-o022c-q"]},"time":{"label":"初平三年冬","year":192,"precision":"year","basis":"纪年经本批逐段审定；年份依据见所引原文纪年与现代注释。","evidence":["wudi-e-o022c-q","wudi-q-o019","wudi-q-b-3863a19b555811d1f415"],"chronology":"wudi-y192","dating_review":{"anchor":"wudi-q-o019","basis":"初平三年冬","reviewed":true}},"source_order":[1,163,"O022c"],"order":84}],"persons":[{"id":"cao-cao","name":"曹操","facts":[],"aliases":[]}],"evidence":[{"id":"wudi-e-o022c-q","section":"chapter-001","block":"b-5505cac06f9494b001a0","layer":"original","quote":"追黄巾，至济北〖12〗；乞降。冬，受降卒三十余万，男女百余万口。收其精锐者，号为“青州兵”。","section_title":"武帝纪第一","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0007_split_000.xhtml","index":162,"anchor":null},"note_id":null,"start":82,"end":128},{"id":"wudi-q-b-3863a19b555811d1f415","section":"chapter-001","block":"b-3863a19b555811d1f415","layer":"modern","quote":"〖1〗三年：初平三年（公元 192）。","section_title":"武帝纪第一","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0007_split_000.xhtml","index":152,"anchor":null},"note_id":"n-2063caf2b642ce9ff2bc","start":0,"end":19},{"id":"wudi-q-o019","section":"chapter-001","block":"b-43620706e925cc9a268c","layer":"original","quote":"三年春〖1〗，太祖军顿丘，毒等攻东武阳。太祖乃引兵西入山，攻毒等本屯〖2〗。﹝一﹞毒闻之，弃武阳还〖3〗。太祖要击眭固〖4〗，又击匈奴于夫罗于内黄〖5〗，皆大破之。﹝二﹞","section_title":"武帝纪第一","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0007_split_000.xhtml","index":150,"anchor":null},"note_id":null,"start":0,"end":85}],"profiles":{},"directory_counts":{}}
